<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>GoTypeSwitch - Tag - loommii</title><link>https://loommii.github.io/en/tags/gotypeswitch/</link><description>我的个人技术博客</description><generator>Hugo 0.165.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 16 Jan 2026 01:28:43 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://loommii.github.io/en/tags/gotypeswitch/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Go Daily Question 036</title><link>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_036/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Dec 2024 20:44:12 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_036/</guid><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/godailyquestion/">GoDailyQuestion</category><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/golanguagebasics/">GoLanguageBasics</category><description>&lt;p&gt;Will the following code compile? If so, what will be the output?&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;func GetValue() int {&#10; return 1&#10;}&#10;&#10;func main() {&#10; i := GetValue()&#10; switch i.(type) {&#10; case int:&#10; println(&amp;#34;int&amp;#34;)&#10; case string:&#10; println(&amp;#34;string&amp;#34;)&#10; case interface{}:&#10; println(&amp;#34;interface&amp;#34;)&#10; default:&#10; println(&amp;#34;unknown&amp;#34;)&#10; }&#10;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10;&lt;details&gt;&#10; &lt;summary&gt;🔑 Answer Analysis:&lt;/summary&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;Answer: Compilation error.&#10;Type assertion is used here. However, note that only interface types can perform type assertion. &lt;code&gt;i.(type)&lt;/code&gt; is used here, but the type of &lt;code&gt;i&lt;/code&gt; is &lt;code&gt;int&lt;/code&gt;, not an interface.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>